          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Laugh and play as you buzz through the fun-filled world of bugs. You'll be bug-eyed with excitement at all you can do as you scurry through this world of tiny creatures. In addition to lots of playful activities--a board game, puppet show, and swarms of surprises--your friend Flik is counting on you to help him save the colony by finding items he needs to build a grasshopper-keeper-outer invention. So get ready for a really big adventure into the tiny world of bugs. Hop to it!",
